# What gets UPLOADED to Vercel. An allowlist: the page is static and committed
# to public/ by CI (no build step, never serve the repo root - news-radar once
# served its whole source tree that way). api/ + package files are the morning
# digest's two functions and their one dependency (web-push), since 2026-10-21.
/*
!/public
!/vercel.json
!/api
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
